    "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Numeri\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}}}} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">Scrivi un titolo che attiri l&#039;attenzione del tuo pubblico</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"columnCount\":3,\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"300px\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0.0625rem\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-width:0.0625rem;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"large\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">01. Primo elemento</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"1rem\"}}}} --><p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, commodo erat adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod ut tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0.0625rem\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-width:0.0625rem;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"large\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">02. Secondo elemento</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"1rem\"}}}} --><p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Integer enim risus, suscipit eu iaculis sed, ullamcorper at metus. Venenatis nec convallis magna, eu congue velit.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0.0625rem\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-width:0.0625rem;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"large\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">03. Terzo elemento</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"1rem\"}}}} --><p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Aliquam tempus mi nulla porta luctus. Sed non neque at lectus bibendum blandit. Morbi fringilla sapien libero.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0.0625rem\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-width:0.0625rem;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"large\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">04. Quarto elemento</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"1rem\"}}}} --><p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Duis enim elit, porttitor id feugiat at, blandit at erat. Proin varius libero sit amet tortor volutpat diam laoreet.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0.0625rem\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-width:0.0625rem;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"large\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">05. Quinto elemento</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"1rem\"}}}} --><p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Fusce sed magna eu ligula commodo hendrerit fringilla ac purus. Integer sagittis efficitur rhoncus justo.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0.0625rem\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"border-top-width:0.0625rem;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"large\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">06. Sesto elemento</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"1rem\"}}}} --><p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Mauris dui tellus mollis quis varius, sit amet ultrices in leo. Cras et purus sit amet velit congue convallis nec id diam.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group -->"
